WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.677 --> 00:00:26.539
The next morning Cinderella started her chores.

2
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:31.999
Stepmother barked orders at her.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.081
But it didn't bother Cinderella today.

4
00:00:38.082 --> 00:00:41.855
"Last night was lovely," she thought.

5
00:00:41.856 --> 00:00:47.128
"I wish every night was that wonderful."

6
00:00:47.129 --> 00:00:54.332
Cinderella hummed as she swept the floor.

7
00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:57.373
"Quiet down!" Stepmother snapped.

8
00:00:57.374 --> 00:01:00.083
"You're giving me a headache!"

9
00:01:00.084 --> 00:01:03.064
"Yes, Stepmother," Cinderella said.

10
00:01:03.065 --> 00:01:05.741
Cinderella worked quietly.

11
00:01:05.742 --> 00:01:14.310
But in her head, she was still singing.

12
00:01:14.311 --> 00:01:20.860
"Grr . . ." Stepmother stomped around the room.

13
00:01:20.861 --> 00:01:25.788
"Why did that princess appear at the ball last night?"

14
00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:29.305
"She ruined everything," Trudy said.

15
00:01:29.306 --> 00:01:32.270
"The prince never noticed me."

16
00:01:32.271 --> 00:01:36.737
"The prince didn't notice me either," Gert said.

17
00:01:36.738 --> 00:01:40.286
"I must wear more jewels tonight."

18
00:01:40.287 --> 00:01:42.339
Stepmother frowned.

19
00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:49.487
"Tonight you both must look your best!"

20
00:01:49.488 --> 00:01:57.093
Trudy and Gert spent all afternoon getting ready.

21
00:01:57.094 --> 00:02:05.600
Finally they left for the ball.

22
00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:10.829
Cinderella felt sad—then Godmother appeared!

23
00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:15.212
"Ready to go to another ball, Cinderella?"

24
00:02:15.213 --> 00:02:18.266
"Yes!" Cinderella cried.

25
00:02:18.267 --> 00:02:21.928
Her godmother waved her wand. Zap!

26
00:02:21.929 --> 00:02:26.413
Once again Cinderella wore the glass shoes.

27
00:02:26.414 --> 00:02:37.847
But tonight she had a different gown.

28
00:02:37.848 --> 00:02:52.042
All night long Cinderella danced with the prince.

29
00:02:52.043 --> 00:02:56.877
"You look even more beautiful tonight," he said.

30
00:02:56.878 --> 00:03:00.065
Cinderella closed her eyes.

31
00:03:00.066 --> 00:03:03.954
"I never want to leave," she whispered.

32
00:03:03.955 --> 00:03:07.024
Bong! Bong! Bong!

33
00:03:07.025 --> 00:03:13.773
Just then the clock struck—12 o'clock!
